<http://data.silknow.org/object/b8ae8ae4-996c-320e-a025-501e64d07ef4>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Description: Cover of woven silk and metal thread backed with plain weave cotton and faced with silk.\nThe off-white silk ground of the joined cover is woven in blue, orange and beige silk and metal thread [silver strip open S-wound on a yellow silk core] with a dense pattern of meandering, floral branches.  \n Backing: striped light green, plain weave cotton with dark green and ochre.\nFacing: bias cut, striped silk in dark blue and white with stylised floral meanders."@en , "woven silk, 1700s, Persian; Flowers"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/b3c18420-d803-3ad8-94f3-894e648a2cae> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/e5366757-83f0-30fd-ac42-5ce07750cfc5> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Description: Cover of woven silk and metal thread backed with plain weave cotton and faced with silk.\nThe off-white silk ground of the joined cover is woven in blue, orange and beige silk and metal thread [silver strip open S-wound on a yellow silk core] with a dense pattern of meandering, floral branches.  \n Backing: striped light green, plain weave cotton with dark green and ochre.\nFacing: bias cut, striped silk in dark blue and white with stylised floral meanders."@en , "woven silk, 1700s, Persian; Flowers"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/b8ae8ae4-996c-320e-a025-501e64d07ef4/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/b8ae8ae4-996c-320e-a025-501e64d07ef4/dimension/2> ;
